---
import ToolsGrid from '../react/ToolsGrid';
---

<section id="tools" class="py-20 border-t border-brand-hairline dark:border-brand-border/80 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="reveal text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-accent tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">Tools</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ivory" data-i18n="tools_title">内置工具矩阵</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-muted mt-3" data-i18n="tools_subtitle">智能体在每一步 ReAct 循环中，在权限约束下调用这些工具。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <ToolsGrid client:visible />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs" data-i18n-aria="tools_legend" aria-label="工具安全等级图例">
      <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/40 text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/50 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span data-i18n="tools_danger_label">危险工具（需审批）</span>
      </span>
      <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-900/50 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span data-i18n="tools_safe_label">安全工具（静默放行）</span>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 text-center">
      <span class="text-xs text-brand-muted" data-i18n="tools_footnote">工具定义与桌面端 electron/tool-defs.ts 保持同步。</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
